<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Raiyan | Photography Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: #0f0f11; color: #e1e1e6; line-height: 1.6; }
        header { text-align: center; padding: 60px 20px 40px; background: #16161a; border-bottom: 1px solid #242429; }
        h1 { font-size: 2.8rem; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 1px; }
        p.subtitle { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #a0a0b0; margin-top: 8px; }
        .about { max-width: 800px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; text-align: center; color: #c4c4d0; }
        .skills-tag { display: inline-block; background: #242429; color: #00d26a; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 15px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .gallery-container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; }
        .section-title { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #ffffff; border-left: 4px solid #00d26a; padding-left: 10px; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 50px; }
        .card { background: #16161a; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #242429; transition: transform 0.3s ease; }
        .card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); }
        .card img { width: 100%; height: 250px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
        .card-content { padding: 15px; }
        .card-title { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .card-desc { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #9090a0; }
        footer { text-align: center; padding: 40px 20px; background: #16161a; border-top: 1px solid #242429; }
        .contact-links a { color: #00d26a; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px; font-weight: 500; }
        .contact-links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Raiyan</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Student & Aspiring Photographer from Bangladesh</p>
        <span class="skills-tag">Adobe Lightroom Specialist</span>
    </header>

    <section class="about">
        <p>Passionate about visual storytelling through portraiture, urban dynamics, character cosplay, and everyday life. Focused on moody color grading, atmospheric lighting, and high-contrast aesthetics.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="gallery-container">
        
        <div class="section-title">Cosplay & Character Portraits</div>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <img src="IMG_3314.JPG" alt="Cosplay Portrait">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="card-title">Armored Focus</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">High-contrast portrait showcasing intricate metallic textures and bold silhouette work.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <img src="IMG_2241.JPG" alt="Cosplay Portrait">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="card-title">Wanderer in Warmth</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">Atmospheric lighting capturing expressive character presence in a lively setting.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <img src="IMG_1162.JPG" alt="Cosplay Portrait">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="card-title">Gothic Elegance</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">Moody color grading emphasizing subtle highlights and dark aesthetic tones.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">Urban, Automotive & Life</div>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <img src="IMG_0914.JPG" alt="Automotive Detail">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="card-title">Precision & Curves</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">Low-angle shot highlighting metallic reflections and sleek automotive geometry.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <img src="1930C2D1-DA6D-4771-8629-3E061BE91623.JPG" alt="Featured Shot">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="card-title">Urban Aesthetics</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">Cinematic warm-toned view capturing daily life and environmental moments.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <footer>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Get in touch for collaborations or inquiries:</p>
        <div class="contact-links">
            <a href="mailto:raiyan63177@gmail.com">raiyan63177@gmail.com</a> | 
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/km.raiyan?igsi=bW52MG9qcHdxaG96" target="_blank">Instagram (@km.raiyan)</a>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
